  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho ni, Obwakyabazinga obw'omu igulu bulifaanana ng'abaghala eikumi abaagema amataala gaibwe ni baja okusangaalira eyali abayiiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abataanu ku abo baali basiru, ate abataanu nga bagezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba abasiru baatwala amataala gaibwe, aye tibaatwala mafuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abagezi baatwala enthupa edh'amafuta ghalala n'amataala gaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayiiza bwe yalwagho okutuuka, boonaboona baawongera era baatenduka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu bwire ghagati ghabaagho aleekaana ati, ‘Abayiiza wuuno atuuse! Mwidhe mumusangaalire.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abaghala boonaboona baazuuka, baatereeza amataala gaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasiru baakoba abagezi bati, ‘Mutughe ku mafuta gaimwe, kuba amataala gaife gali kuzikira.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abagezi baabakoba bati, ‘Gasobola obutatumala ife n'imwe ekisinga muje ye bagatunda mwegulireyo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baaja okugula amafuta abayiiza yaatuuka, era abo abaali beetegeike bangira naye ku mbaga, olwigi lwaigalwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga ghabiseegho entangama, abaghala bale abandi boona baidha, baakoba bati, ‘Musengwa, Musengwa twiguliregho.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 13:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye yaabairamu ati, ‘Bwenebwene ka mbakobere, tibaidhi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho ni, mumoge kuba timwidhi lunaku waire saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuba kiriba oti n'omuntu eyali aja mu lugendo n'ayeta abagheereza be n'abagemya ebintu bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala yamugha talanta ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " itaanu, owundi ibiri, n'owundi ndala, ng'ajiira ku busobozi bwaibwe, yaaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyafuna talanta eitaanu yaja mangu ago yaadhisuubuza, yaazaazaamu talanta edhindi itaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'eyafuna talanta eibiri yeena atyo, yaaja yaazaazaamu edhindi ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ole eyafuna endala, yaaja yaasima mu itaka, yaaziika omwo lupiiya ya musengwa we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga ghabiseegho entangama, musengwa w'abagheereza abo yaira yaababuuza ebigema ku bibye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyafuna talanta eitaanu yaaseeta ni talanta edhindi itaanu yaakoba ati, ‘Musengwa, wampa talanta itaanu aye bona nazaazaamu talanta edhindi itaanu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa we yaamukoba ati, ‘Weekaza, omugheereza omulungi era omwesigwa obaire mwesigwa mu bitono, ndidha kukugemya ebingi ingira mu isanhu lya Musengwa wo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“N'oyo eyafuna talanta eibiri yaaseeta, yaakoba ati, ‘Musengwa, wampa talanta ibiri aye bona, nazaazaamu talanta edhindi ibiri.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa we yaamukoba ati, ‘Weekaza, omugheereza omulungi era omwesigwa obaire mwesigwa mu bitono, ndidha kukugemya ebingi ingira mu isanhu lya musengwa wo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Era n'oyo eyafuna talanta endala yaaseeta, yaakoba ati, ‘Musengwa, namanha ng'oli muntu mukalangufu, okungula by'otaasimba, ate waasololeza y'otaasigira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale, natya, talanta yo naaja naagigisa mu itaka gema, ebibyo biibyo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye musengwa we yaamwiramu ng'akoba ati, ‘Mugheereza iwe omubi, era omugayaavu! Wamanha oti nkungula ye ntaasimba, oti era nsoloza ye ntaasigira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni, wali ogwaine okugha lupiiya yange abasuubuzi, era okwira nga nfuna kyange n'amagoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mumutooleku talanta eyo mugighe ole ali n'eikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba buli aliku ni ky'ali nakyo alyongerwaku yaaba na bingi, aye azira, n'ekyo ky'ali nakyo kirimutoolebwaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
